    <edge source="Unconditional Licence" target="Blackout">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A person should not drive for ten years following two or more blackouts of undetermined nature separated by a twenty-four-hour period.&lt;SEP&gt;A person should not drive for five years following a single blackout of undetermined nature.</data>
