    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Driver Licensing Authority">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The driver licensing authority may consider granting a conditional licence to a person with blackout history subject to annual review and specific criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;The Driver Licensing Authority may consider granting a conditional licence subject to annual reviews.&lt;SEP&gt;The driver licensing authority considers a conditional licence for drivers with blackouts, subject to at least annual review.&lt;SEP&gt;The Driver Licensing Authority makes licensing decisions based on a full consideration of relevant factors relating to health and driving performance.</data>
